{"verse_key": "13:41", "surah": 13, "verse": 41, "text_uthmani": "أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ أَنَّا نَأْتِى ٱلْأَرْضَ نَنقُصُهَا مِنْ أَطْرَافِهَا ۚ وَٱللَّهُ يَحْكُمُ لَا مُعَقِّبَ لِحُكْمِهِۦ ۚ وَهُوَ سَرِيعُ ٱلْحِسَابِ", "translation": "Have they not seen that We set upon the land, reducing it from its borders?<sup foot_note=196562>1</sup> And Allāh decides; there is no adjuster of His decision. And He is swift in account.", "verse_from_ms": 1014870, "verse_to_ms": 1032500, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "أَوَلَمْ", "start_ms": 1014870, "end_ms": 1015940}, {"i": 1, "text": "يَرَوْا۟", "start_ms": 1015940, "end_ms": 1016610}, {"i": 2, "text": "أَنَّا", "start_ms": 1016610, "end_ms": 1017750}, {"i": 3, "text": "نَأْتِى", "start_ms": 1017750, "end_ms": 1018320}, {"i": 4, "text": "ٱلْأَرْضَ", "start_ms": 1018320, "end_ms": 1019130}, {"i": 5, "text": "نَنقُصُهَا", "start_ms": 1019130, "end_ms": 1020690}, {"i": 6, "text": "مِنْ", "start_ms": 1020690, "end_ms": 1021090}, {"i": 7, "text": "أَطْرَافِهَا", "start_ms": 1021090, "end_ms": 1022660}, {"i": 8, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 1022660, "end_ms": 1024230}, {"i": 9, "text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "start_ms": 1024230, "end_ms": 1025020}, {"i": 10, "text": "يَحْكُمُ", "start_ms": 1025020, "end_ms": 1025410}, {"i": 11, "text": "لَا", "start_ms": 1025410, "end_ms": 1026390}, {"i": 12, "text": "مُعَقِّبَ", "start_ms": 1026390, "end_ms": 1027550}, {"i": 13, "text": "لِحُكْمِهِۦ", "start_ms": 1027550, "end_ms": 1028640}, {"i": 14, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 1028640, "end_ms": 1029540}, {"i": 15, "text": "وَهُوَ", "start_ms": 1029540, "end_ms": 1032455}, {"i": 16, "text": "سَرِيعُ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 17, "text": "ٱلْحِسَابِ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}